@startuml 010-team-limit-50-sequence
title 010 team-limit-50：時序圖（設定 50 組與邊界拒絕）

actor "老師" as T
actor "第50組學生" as S50
participant "Teacher" as Web
participant "app.py" as App
participant "Activity" as Act
participant "views" as Views

T -> Web : 在準備階段輸入 50
Web -> App : 設定組數 {count: 50}
App -> Act : set_teams(50)
Act -> Act : 驗證 2 <= 50 <= 50
Act -> Act : 建立第1組至第50組\n撤銷舊身分、邀請碼與草稿
Act --> App : 50 組
App -> Views : 重算各連線畫面
App --> Web : 顯示第1組至第50組

S50 -> App : 選擇第50組加入
App -> Act : join(第50組)
Act --> App : 第50組身分
App --> S50 : 進入第50組學生畫面

T -> Web : 輸入 51
Web -> App : 設定組數 {count: 51}
App -> Act : set_teams(51)
Act --> App : 拒絕超出範圍
App --> Web : 顯示 2–50 範圍錯誤
note right of Act : 原 50 組與既有狀態不變
@enduml
